        <p>
          Review the vocabulary in this lesson. Drag the vocabulary term from the left and drop it
          on its correct definition on the right.
          Click the "Check Me" button to see if you are correct.
        </p>
      </statement>

      <feedback>
        <p>Find the words in the lesson above and try again.</p>
      </feedback>

      <cardsort>
        <match>
          <premise>pair programming</premise>
          <response>a collaboration practice in which two programmers work together at one computer</response>
        </match>
        <match>
